    "summary_one_sentence": "When ten-year-old Arco accidentally time-travels from the far future to the year 2075 after losing control of his rainbow suit, he must rely on a young girl named Iris to help him find a way home.",
    "summary_short": "Set in a distant future, ten-year-old Arco takes his first flight in a vibrant rainbow suit, only to lose control and fall back through time into the year 2075. Disoriented and stranded, he is rescued by Iris, an empathetic girl his own age who vows to help him return to his era. Together, the pair face unexpected challenges while building a bond that bridges two different times. Their imaginative journey becomes a race against time as Iris tries every resource available to reunite Arco with his home world.",
    "summary_long": "In a far-off future, ten-year-old Arco prepares for a major milestone: his inaugural flight wearing a powerful rainbow suit. However, during his maiden voyage, a sudden loss of control sends him spiraling through time, ultimately crash-landing in the year 2075. Disoriented and far from home, Arco is discovered by Iris, a resourceful ten-year-old girl living in this mid-century world. Recognizing that Arco is from a distant future, Iris decides to help him by any means necessary. As the two kids work together to fix his gear and figure out a pathway back to his timeline, they navigate various obstacles in a changing world. Along the way, their shared experience transforms into a heartwarming journey of mutual trust, courage, and friendship. Through determination and creative problem-solving, Iris stands as Arco's steadfast guide in an unfamiliar era. Ultimately, their time together leaves an indelible mark on both of their lives as they strive to get Arco safely home.",
    "synopsis": "Arco is an animated family adventure that blends vibrant science-fiction elements with a tender, character-driven story. When ten-year-old Arco accidentally travels backward through time to 2075 during a runaway flight in his rainbow suit, he finds an unlikely ally in Iris, a girl his age who is determined to rescue him. Filled with wonder and heart, this spoiler-free tale focuses on their growing bond, creative problem-solving, and the universal power of childhood empathy across time.",
